OL,3,GNEWSAFriend's plea for nurse missing in
OL,4,ANepal-Tibet flood
OL,5,
OL,6,F"My dear sister, wherever you are,
OL,7,Fplease stay strong. We are praying for
OL,8,Fyour safety every moment and waiting
OL,9,Fdesperately for you to return home," he
OL,10,Fwrote on social media.
